WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:02.035
SHIV ROY:<i> I hear you're putting
 some names together</i>

00:00:02.135 --> 00:00:03.135
for Dad's CEO search.

00:00:03.235 --> 00:00:04.838
<i> Leaning towards someone,
 say like me,</i>

00:00:04.938 --> 00:00:06.539
who wants to kill you,
or yourself

00:00:06.639 --> 00:00:08.874
for a second chance at
a multi-million dollar pay day.

00:00:08.974 --> 00:00:10.276
♪ (TENSE MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:10.376 --> 00:00:12.412
Mr. Roy. A pleasure
to welcome you home.

00:00:12.879 --> 00:00:14.848
CONNOR ROY:<i> How great it is
 to celebrate our dad's life.</i>

00:00:15.248 --> 00:00:17.416
Shout out to Rhea for planning
a wonderful funeral.

00:00:18.050 --> 00:00:19.685
(CHUCKING) I mean, memorial.

00:00:20.553 --> 00:00:21.554
SHIV:
<i>We need to call a family truce.</i>

00:00:21.654 --> 00:00:24.223
Rhea is dangerous.
We should have a plan

00:00:24.324 --> 00:00:25.858
<i>in case Dad does something rash.</i>

00:00:25.958 --> 00:00:27.092
KENDALL ROY:
<i> Keep it in the family.</i>

00:00:27.193 --> 00:00:28.227
SHIV:
<i> We need to stop her.</i>

00:00:28.561 --> 00:00:31.630
I think we share
some similar interests.

00:00:31.997 --> 00:00:33.366
♪ (MUSIC CONCLUDES) ♪

